{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase/obtain blank cards and attributes \u27a1 Customize your cards and deck\u00a0\u27a1 Battle enemies\u00a0\u27a1\u00a0Get card attributes and currency from winning\u00a0\u27a1\u00a0Progress the story in key battles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tyrant king has become obsessed with ruling the entire world, and to do this he plans to take control of the 5<strong>\u00a0</strong>Legendary\u00a0<i>Bespoke Cards</i>\u00a0spread across the land, these cards of which hold immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way to each of the temples where the cards are held and get the cards before he can, defeating his guards along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards can be customized both aesthetically and mechanically in the following ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portrait Image</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Name</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active/Passive Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health/Strength Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aura Effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities are where the customization shines, as there are many ability types that can be used active or passively in different combinations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043360?t=1761243661","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043360?t=1761243661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043360/71deb7378132cdc8c62aa8572b161b4c443b2e40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761243661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043360/71deb7378132cdc8c62aa8572b161b4c443b2e40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761243661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase/obtain blank cards and attributes \u27a1 Customize your cards and deck\u00a0\u27a1 Battle enemies\u00a0\u27a1\u00a0Get card attributes and currency from winning\u00a0\u27a1\u00a0Progress the story in key battles</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tyrant king has become obsessed with ruling the entire world, and to do this he plans to take control of the 5<strong>\u00a0</strong>Legendary\u00a0<i>Bespoke Cards</i>\u00a0spread across the land, these cards of which hold immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way to each of the temples where the cards are held and get the cards before he can, defeating his guards along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards can be customized both aesthetically and mechanically in the following ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portrait Image</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Name</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active/Passive Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health/Strength Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aura Effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities are where the customization shines, as there are many ability types that can be used active or passively in different combinations.</p>","developers":["Matthew Satterfield"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_